<title>INDIA: Dunlop India receives $4.5 mln order.</title>
<headline>Dunlop India receives $4.5 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial components maker Dunlop India Ltd said on Tuesday it had won a $4.5 million Australian order for steel cord belting.</p>
<p>Dunlop said in a statement the order was placed by the Queensland Ports Authority through a global tender.</p>
<p>The Indian firm said it won the order despite heavy competition from American, Japanese, European and Australian manufacturers.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
